#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: Confirm deployment and establish the immediate objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l001"
msgstr "ROOK, rozmieszczenie potwierdzone. Wieża mieszkalna Ashfall, sektor siódmy."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: State the required mission sequence concisely.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l002"
msgstr "Przywróć zasilanie sektora, odzyskaj uwięzioną grupę ochrony i dotrzyj do połączenia tranzytowego."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Establish that VECTOR is active elsewhere in Ashfall District.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l001"
msgstr "WIEŻA, WEKTOR. Jestem dwie przecznice na wschód. Ten sam ogień, ta sama martwa komunikacja."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Direct attention toward the drones without stopping the tutorial.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l002"
msgstr "Coś kieruje drony w stronę zajętych pięter. Wyśledzę to stąd."

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Introduce the first contradiction in ROOK’s remembered history.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l001"
msgstr "Kapitanie?"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Make the recognition specific without explaining it.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l002"
msgstr "Widziałem, jak umierałeś na moście Pustułki. Osiem lat temu."

#. Speaker: ROOK
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Keep ROOK controlled and focused on the rescue.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l003"
msgstr "Masz złego żołnierza. Czy możesz się ruszyć?"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Offer a plausible explanation while redirecting the mission.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l001"
msgstr "Narażenie neurologiczne może powodować fałszywe rozpoznanie i projekcję tożsamości."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Close the interruption and return the player to the objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l002"
msgstr "Zabezpiecz ocalałego i kontynuuj tranzyt."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M06 arrival; OPERATOR's final direct address before becoming unreachable.
#: missions/m06.md
msgid "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"
msgstr "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M09 Imprint Zero activation; machine-directed command, not an address to the crew.
